  "text": "AfDB approves loan for the Mwinilunga-Jimbe road\n\nThe African Development Bank (AfDB) has approved a US$255 million loan to Zambia for the Lobito Integrated Economic Corridor Development Project. The loan finances the upgrade of the 110 kilometre Mwinilunga-Jimbe road (T5) and a one-stop border post at Jimbe.\n\nThe Road Development Agency will issue a general procurement notice for the civil works in October 2026.",
